    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-section
  background-color="#eff1f4"
  padding="1px 0.5px 1px 1px"
  border-radius="5px"
>
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="5px" padding="0px">
    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-text
      padding="16px 12px 0px 12px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2
        style="
          font-size: 24px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          font-weight: 400;
          margin: 0;
        "
      >
        Elegance in motion
      </h2>
    </mj-text>

    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px"
      padding="10px 12px"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.dubaisummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="REPLACE_ME"
      href="https://www.dubaisummary.com/"
      target="_blank"
    />

    <mj-text
      padding="10px 12px 16px 12px"
      font-family="Arial"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0">On 17 May 2026, internationally acclaimed ballerina Svetlana Zakharova returns with MODANSE, a one-night double bill featuring the Bolshoi Theatre ensemble. The programme opens with Come Un Respiro, set to Handel and choreographed by Mauro Bigonzetti, followed by Gabrielle Chanel, a tribute exploring Coco Chanel’s life through movement, music, and couture costumes by CHANEL.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0">Blending ballet, fashion, and expressive storytelling, the performance celebrates transformation, elegance, and artistic freedom through two distinct contemporary choreographic works.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0">🔗 <strong>Link:</strong> <a style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;" href="https://dubai.platinumlist.net/event-tickets/104374/gabrielle-chanel-ballet" target="_blank">Svetlana Zakharova - Gabrielle Chanel Ballet</a><br />📅 <strong>When:</strong> May 17, Sunday at 08:00 pm<br />💸 <strong>Cost:</strong> Tickets start from AED 190.28<br />📍 <strong>Where:</strong> Dubai Opera</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

