        "
      >
        <strong>Carmen in Concert by UAE National Orchestra</strong>
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">Carmen comes alive in a powerful symphonic concert by the UAE National Orchestra, featuring iconic arias and orchestral highlights from Bizet’s legendary opera. Joined by Dubai Singers and The Stage House Choir, the performance captures the passion, drama, and timeless brilliance.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">
              📅 <strong>When:</strong> <a
          style="
