      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">AFROBESSQUE Live in Dubai promises an immersive Afro House experience blending hypnotic beats with live Ney performances and high-energy DJ sets. Featuring AFROBESSQUE alongside Bazz Key, Qtee Rue, and Taina, the event delivers a stylish night of deep rhythms, music, and vibrant nightlife energy.</p>
