      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px">The newly revamped beach is now open, with a 300-meter stretch open nightly for after-dark swimming. Watch the sunset while playing a game of beach volleyball or checking out the padel courts before heading in for a dip.</p>
